# React UI Patterns

- Functional components + hooks; match existing file style in the same folder.
- Path alias `@/` maps to `src/`.
- Cosmetics/progression: use `useCosmetics()` — never reintroduce remote auth or cloud user APIs.
- Prefer existing shadcn/ui components in `src/components/ui/`.
- Neon/cyber aesthetic: cyan `#00ffc8`, magenta `#ff00ea`, dark `#020408` backgrounds.
- Keep diffs minimal; do not refactor unrelated code.
